(10. Empanelment Criteria for Arbitrators: ODR Institutions must empanel professionals who possess at least ten years of judicial,) Tj
T*
(legal, or financial market experience. Empanelled arbitrators must sign an annual code of conduct confirming independence and neutrality.) Tj
T*
(11. Language of Proceedings: ODR conciliation and arbitration sessions are conducted in English or Hindi, or in any regional language) Tj
T*
(mutually agreed upon by the parties.) Tj
T*
(12. MIS Reporting by MIIs: Stock Exchanges and Depositories shall publish monthly statistics on the number of disputes registered,) Tj
T*
(conciliation success rates, and average time taken for dispute resolution on their websites.) Tj
T*
(Yours faithfully,) Tj
T*
(\(S. Manjesh Roy\)) Tj
T*
(General Manager) Tj
T*
ET
